  Text the reader needs. Ruling R13 and R18: reader keys live here, never in the shared
  strings.xml, so parallel units cannot collide on one file. Android merges every values/*.xml,
  so the keys still resolve as com.shinsaikou.i18n.R.string.*.

  Keys a vendored reader file references keep upstream's name and upstream's English text. Keys that are
  fresh are marked as such.
-->
